se btn-blank feedback-close\">Zapri</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"js-success\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t    <p class=\"large\">\n\t\t\t\t    \t<strong>\n\t\t\t\t        \n\t\t\t\t            Hvala za vaš odziv.\n\t\t\t\t        \n\t\t            \t</strong>\n\t\t            </p>\n\t\t            \n\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"js-success-reply\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\t\t\t\t    \t<div class=\"inside\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    <p>Če želite na vaš odziv prejeti odgovor odgovorne institucije, lahko zaprosite za odgovor.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    <p class=\"small\">Ob kliku na gumb se bo odprl vaš privzeti program za pošiljanje elektronske pošte in v njem samodejno pripravil osnutek sporočila, ki ga lahko pošljete instituciji, pristojni za vsebino na tej spletni strani.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t    <div class=\"feedback-reply-action\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    \t<p><a href=\"\" data-email=\"GA.1FI@API4.DI@\" data-subject=\"GOV.SI%20%7C%20Pro%C5%A1nja%20za%20odgovor\" data-body=\"Odziv%20na%20stran%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gov.si%2Fzbirke%2Fjavne-objave%2Fjavni-razpis-vlaganja-v-razvoj-celovitih-turisticnih-produktov-v-obliki-avtenticnih-turisticnih-dozivetij-vob-objektih-kulturne-dediscine-v-kohezijski-regiji-vzhodna-slovenija%2F%20%0D%0A-------------%0D%0A%5BKomentar%2Futemeljitev%5D%0D%0A-------------\" class=\"js-obfuscated-body\">Zaprosite za odgovor</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t    \n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"adapt\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"page-meta-details\">\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<dl>\n\t\t\t\t<dt>Odgovorna institucija:</dt> \n\t\t\t\t<dd>\n\t\t\t\t\tMinistrstvo za gospodarstvo, turizem in šport\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"page-meta-email\"><span class=\"page-meta-